# ---- Large regenerable intermediates from the embedding pipeline ----
# These are float text dumps (tens of MB) produced by make_sbert_embeddings.py.
# They are NOT needed to run the app — the app loads the small quantized .bin
# assets in p5Dumpster/*/data/, which ARE tracked. Regenerate with:
#   python textanalysis/make_sbert_embeddings.py ...
